  "text": "### Scenario 2: Existing Customer — Adding Product  \n**Customer:** \"I have a Current Account here. Should I get your savings account too?\"  \n**Your Response:**\n\"Absolutely! We recommend both. Use your Current Account for daily spending and bills, and open a SmartSaver for your savings.  \nYour Current Account earns 0%, but SmartSaver earns 4.50%–4.80% AER. It's a great way to maximize your interest without losing access to your money.\"",
